      "comment": "ORMOND ROAD (7) was no match for the winner here two back but he improved sharply at Eagle Farm when finishing 2 lengths away in fourth. Looms as the main danger. MISS DYNAMO (4) was closing off strongly last time over 2200m at this track, beaten 4 lengths into fifth. Key jockey switch in Thompson. Not to be underestimated. PAPAL MISS (6) doesn't win out of turn but has good runs littered through her form that can see her threaten. CONEY ISLAND BABY (3) did little and finished a disappointing tenth over 1400m at this track last start, a less impressive effort than his fifth at Toowoomba the run before. Suitably placed so anticipating a better run this time.",
